      "translatedText": "This parameter does not directly control the model dimensions or the collision envelope\\. If an obstacle has only valid echoes above 0\\.5 m, these points will be filtered out; decreasing it may miss obstacles, while increasing it may introduce more suspended structures into the output\\. It must be verified against the real vehicle envelope, the obstacle parts visible to the radar, and downstream filtering; it cannot be set to the full vehicle height based on the name alone\\.",
